## You may

Share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially: print them, put them in an app or a book,
turn them into cross-stitch or bead charts, train on them, resell what you build from them.

## You must give credit

Keep a credit that names SquareColoring and links to it. Any of these does the job:

> Colour-by-number templates by SquareColoring (https://www.squarecoloring.com)

For a single template, each JSON file carries its own `credit` field, for example:

> “Chubby Bumblebee” colour-by-number template by SquareColoring — https://www.squarecoloring.com/page/chubby-bumblebee

In a printed work, the link may be written out as plain text. In software, an About or Credits screen is
the usual place.

## Who may license this

Only the sheets drawn on SquareColoring's own team accounts are in this package. Sheets made by members
of the site are not included — see [SOURCES.md](SOURCES.md).
